<title>SINGAPORE: Hong Fok unit to sell Hong Kong property.</title>
<headline>Hong Fok unit to sell Hong Kong property.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Fok Corp said on Monday that a subsidiary of its associate firm, Winfoong International Ltd, had agreed to sell a prime district property in Hong Kong for approximately Singapore $40.5 million.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the sale, by World Profit Ltd, would take place on or before July 25 and was agreed subject to existing tenancies.</p>
<p>It estimated the sale of the property would contribute about S$3.7 million to the group's profit before tax but would not have any material effect on its net tangible assets.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
